1
00:01:53,459 --> 00:01:54,159
Hey, isn't that

2
00:01:54,159 --> 00:01:55,560
Lieutenant Jiang, the translator?

3
00:01:55,560 --> 00:01:56,700
What's he doing here?

4
00:02:04,680 --> 00:02:05,640
General Yu!

5
00:02:08,259 --> 00:02:09,259
Good to see you!

6
00:02:11,500 --> 00:02:13,280
Welcome to Nanhuai,

7
00:02:13,280 --> 00:02:14,319
General Gao.

8
00:02:14,560 --> 00:02:16,039
My father got caught up in his duties,

9
00:02:16,039 --> 00:02:16,979
but insisted that

10
00:02:17,340 --> 00:02:18,680
I see to your every comfort.

11
00:02:18,879 --> 00:02:19,819
I'm honored,

12
00:02:20,039 --> 00:02:21,139
General.

13
00:02:21,740 --> 00:02:23,060
Your family's commitment

14
00:02:23,060 --> 00:02:24,819
is what keeps

15
00:02:25,039 --> 00:02:26,060
this city safe.

16
00:02:26,180 --> 00:02:27,960
With you two running things,

17
00:02:28,460 --> 00:02:30,099
we have nothing to worry about.

18
00:02:31,280 --> 00:02:32,379
Now, let me introduce

19
00:02:32,879 --> 00:02:34,539
our new Director of Propaganda,

20
00:02:34,960 --> 00:02:37,139
Jiang Xueting,

21
00:02:37,379 --> 00:02:39,419
and his fiancée, Miss Tao.

22
00:02:40,419 --> 00:02:42,319
Brightest mind we've got,

23
00:02:42,879 --> 00:02:43,800
he's running

24
00:02:43,800 --> 00:02:45,439
the whole show now.

25
00:02:46,300 --> 00:02:47,699
All our media

26
00:02:47,699 --> 00:02:49,120
falls under

27
00:02:49,539 --> 00:02:52,120
his watch.

28
00:02:54,919 --> 00:02:55,759
Long time,

29
00:02:56,740 --> 00:02:57,680
General.

30
00:03:00,960 --> 00:03:02,680
You gentlemen have a history?

31
00:03:03,580 --> 00:03:04,400
I had

32
00:03:04,900 --> 00:03:05,460
the honor

33
00:03:05,460 --> 00:03:07,159
of serving under him.

34
00:03:07,819 --> 00:03:09,199
Everything he taught me...

35
00:03:09,819 --> 00:03:12,620
is burned into my memory!

36
00:03:15,860 --> 00:03:16,539
In fact,

37
00:03:18,120 --> 00:03:19,219
his wife and I

38
00:03:21,599 --> 00:03:23,659
grew up together.

39
00:03:27,020 --> 00:03:28,599
And my bride-to-be

40
00:03:29,139 --> 00:03:30,840
is her own flesh and blood.

41
00:03:33,680 --> 00:03:34,460
So,

42
00:03:35,020 --> 00:03:36,900
you two are practically

43
00:03:37,139 --> 00:03:38,379
in-law?

44
00:03:38,719 --> 00:03:40,240
Small world, isn't it?

45
00:03:42,860 --> 00:03:44,699
You dropped off the map

46
00:03:44,759 --> 00:03:45,979
when you left,

47
00:03:46,379 --> 00:03:49,020
only to reappear at the top...

48
00:03:49,099 --> 00:03:49,580
with both

49
00:03:49,580 --> 00:03:50,979
the Taos and Tangs

50
00:03:51,340 --> 00:03:52,819
in your corner.

51
00:03:54,379 --> 00:03:56,360
You certainly know how to play the game.

52
00:03:59,099 --> 00:04:00,159
We all gotta climb,

53
00:04:01,219 --> 00:04:02,479
General.

54
00:04:03,620 --> 00:04:04,699
The higher you get,

55
00:04:06,620 --> 00:04:07,699
the better the scenery.

56
00:04:13,099 --> 00:04:13,840
Dear sister!

57
00:04:17,139 --> 00:04:19,379
I heard about your accident.

58
00:04:19,540 --> 00:04:20,860
It's left you unwell for years.

59
00:04:21,180 --> 00:04:22,740
I wanted to visit you so badly,

60
00:04:23,180 --> 00:04:24,399
but he's completely

61
00:04:24,860 --> 00:04:26,019
married to his work.

62
00:04:26,759 --> 00:04:27,459
It's fine.

63
00:04:28,139 --> 00:04:30,199
Changxuan has told me about you.

64
00:04:41,939 --> 00:04:42,399
General Gao!

65
00:04:42,680 --> 00:04:44,160
The Southern forces

66
00:04:44,160 --> 00:04:45,639
have swept through

67
00:04:45,879 --> 00:04:47,720
Changsha and Wuhan in rapid succession.

68
00:04:48,040 --> 00:04:49,980
With their Northern Expedition gaining ground,

69
00:04:50,160 --> 00:04:50,740
what is

70
00:04:50,839 --> 00:04:52,959
the government's official stance?

71
00:04:53,379 --> 00:04:54,259
Make no mistake:

72
00:04:55,060 --> 00:04:56,660
this is an insurrection!

73
00:04:57,560 --> 00:05:00,980
A breakaway faction in the south

74
00:05:01,100 --> 00:05:03,379
tearing this country apart!

75
00:05:04,180 --> 00:05:05,500
This administration remains

76
00:05:05,839 --> 00:05:07,560
the sole legitimate authority

77
00:05:07,860 --> 00:05:09,560
of the Republic of China.

78
00:05:10,160 --> 00:05:12,399
Anyone who tries to divide China

79
00:05:12,939 --> 00:05:15,220
will be met with blood and iron!

80
00:05:15,879 --> 00:05:19,360
Well said! General!

81
00:05:20,160 --> 00:05:21,920
General,

82
00:05:21,920 --> 00:05:23,060
your own official press

83
00:05:23,060 --> 00:05:24,279
recently ran articles

84
00:05:24,540 --> 00:05:25,500
hinting that

85
00:05:25,500 --> 00:05:27,439
certain military factions

86
00:05:27,620 --> 00:05:29,579
are no longer loyal

87
00:05:29,740 --> 00:05:31,399
to the administration.

88
00:05:39,660 --> 00:05:40,660
A soldier's only job

89
00:05:41,540 --> 00:05:44,240
is to keep his people safe.

90
00:05:44,980 --> 00:05:46,160
The peace of this city,

91
00:05:47,079 --> 00:05:48,259
the lives of its people...

92
00:05:49,240 --> 00:05:50,259
that is our

93
00:05:50,259 --> 00:05:51,420
one and only mission.

94
00:05:52,420 --> 00:05:53,620
Nothing comes

95
00:05:54,399 --> 00:05:55,579
before that.

96
00:05:55,579 --> 00:05:56,779
Nothing!

97
00:05:57,800 --> 00:05:58,579
And I trust

98
00:05:58,980 --> 00:05:59,860
the administration

99
00:05:59,860 --> 00:06:01,579
shares that

100
00:06:02,259 --> 00:06:03,699
very conviction.

101
00:06:04,480 --> 00:06:06,560
Well spoken!

102
00:06:07,420 --> 00:06:09,060
Could you expand on that, sir?

103
00:06:16,399 --> 00:06:17,220
General, care to elaborate?

104
00:06:17,220 --> 00:06:17,800
General,

105
00:06:17,980 --> 00:06:18,439
just a few words,

106
00:06:18,439 --> 00:06:19,459
please!

107
00:06:20,980 --> 00:06:21,560
Sir,

108
00:06:21,560 --> 00:06:22,620
one more question,

109
00:06:23,379 --> 00:06:24,680
please!

110
00:06:25,180 --> 00:06:26,160
General, please!

111
00:06:27,339 --> 00:06:28,199
Where is Pingjun?

112
00:06:28,639 --> 00:06:30,639
She headed for the garden.

113
00:06:33,079 --> 00:06:35,180
General, a word.

114
00:06:39,360 --> 00:06:40,139
Hey,

115
00:06:40,759 --> 00:06:41,620
I was just watching

116
00:06:41,620 --> 00:06:42,980
your soldiers out there.

117
00:06:43,399 --> 00:06:45,160
Fierce,

118
00:06:45,279 --> 00:06:46,300
disciplined,

119
00:06:46,680 --> 00:06:48,000
a truly formidable force!

120
00:06:48,439 --> 00:06:49,639
You flatter us, sir.

121
00:06:49,959 --> 00:06:51,500
Our boys just train

122
00:06:51,600 --> 00:06:52,980
a little harder.

123
00:06:54,360 --> 00:06:57,000
With troops like yours, Nanhuai won't fall.

124
00:06:57,139 --> 00:06:59,980
Yet... if this army

125
00:07:00,319 --> 00:07:01,860
answers only to the Yus

126
00:07:02,319 --> 00:07:03,639
and ignores our government entirely...

127
00:07:04,439 --> 00:07:06,680
should we feel safe, or terrified?

128
00:07:10,839 --> 00:07:11,959
You got quite a sense of humor, General.

129
00:07:12,860 --> 00:07:13,600
Every man

130
00:07:13,600 --> 00:07:14,639
in my ranks

131
00:07:14,959 --> 00:07:16,079
swears an oath to the nation

132
00:07:16,579 --> 00:07:18,360
on day one.

133
00:07:18,920 --> 00:07:21,180
My father lives by that,

134
00:07:21,920 --> 00:07:22,980
and so do I.

135
00:07:25,980 --> 00:07:27,680
Just pulling your leg, General!

136
00:07:27,860 --> 00:07:28,660
Good to

137
00:07:28,980 --> 00:07:30,699
hear it straight

138
00:07:30,899 --> 00:07:32,100
from you!

139
00:07:32,980 --> 00:07:34,300
Come, let's share a drink together.

140
00:07:34,899 --> 00:07:36,240
You must be exhausted, General.

141
00:07:36,480 --> 00:07:37,899
Why not call it a night?

142
00:07:38,560 --> 00:07:39,279
I've got some foreign guests

143
00:07:39,279 --> 00:07:40,180
to attend to.

144
00:07:40,480 --> 00:07:41,180
Boren,

145
00:07:41,740 --> 00:07:43,100
walk General Gao to the lounge.

146
00:07:43,100 --> 00:07:44,100
Only the top-shelf whiskey.

147
00:07:44,100 --> 00:07:44,639
Got it.

148
00:07:44,939 --> 00:07:46,540
Right this way, sir.

149
00:07:47,100 --> 00:07:47,920
Alright.

150
00:07:48,660 --> 00:07:49,160
After you, sir.

151
00:07:51,939 --> 00:07:52,540
Sir,

152
00:07:53,240 --> 00:07:54,040
Jiang Xueting

153
00:07:54,040 --> 00:07:55,240
has been gone

154
00:07:56,040 --> 00:07:56,920
for years,

155
00:07:56,959 --> 00:07:57,660
and now

156
00:07:57,660 --> 00:07:59,300
he's back with Tao Ziyi on his arm.

157
00:07:59,660 --> 00:08:01,100
Tang Jishan is clearly backing him...

158
00:08:01,300 --> 00:08:02,300
And Mu Linsen too.

159
00:08:03,120 --> 00:08:03,860
Yes...

160
00:08:04,680 --> 00:08:05,480
Mu practically

161
00:08:05,480 --> 00:08:06,139
handed him

162
00:08:06,139 --> 00:08:07,680
that office.

163
00:08:09,680 --> 00:08:12,240
Ruitong, got a task for you.

164
00:08:15,079 --> 00:08:15,759
Pingjun!

165
00:08:20,379 --> 00:08:21,480
At last...

166
00:08:22,939 --> 00:08:23,860
Mr. Jiang...

167
00:08:26,079 --> 00:08:27,180
Can I help you?

168
00:08:29,240 --> 00:08:29,920
Pingjun,

169
00:08:30,560 --> 00:08:31,379
look at me.

170
00:08:31,560 --> 00:08:32,620
Look right at me!

171
00:08:33,159 --> 00:08:33,379
Do you really

172
00:08:33,379 --> 00:08:34,539
remember nothing?

173
00:08:35,320 --> 00:08:35,980
What are you doing?

174
00:08:35,980 --> 00:08:36,820
Let go!

175
00:08:44,840 --> 00:08:48,240
I'm sorry. Don't pull away.

176
00:08:48,779 --> 00:08:49,360
I just lost my head

177
00:08:49,360 --> 00:08:50,539
seeing you again.

178
00:08:52,740 --> 00:08:53,200
Pingjun, you honestly

179
00:08:53,200 --> 00:08:54,519
don't remember?

180
00:08:54,759 --> 00:08:56,360
We grew up side by side.

181
00:08:56,799 --> 00:08:58,000
Even when I left for Japan,

182
00:08:59,440 --> 00:09:00,879
we wrote each other every single week.

183
00:09:03,139 --> 00:09:04,399
Four solid years.

184
00:09:05,100 --> 00:09:06,500
143 letters.

185
00:09:07,500 --> 00:09:08,860
I've kept every single page.

186
00:09:09,980 --> 00:09:11,120
We swore we'd marry

187
00:09:11,860 --> 00:09:14,440
the day I graduated!

188
00:09:19,500 --> 00:09:21,159
[What did he write in his letter, hon?]

189
00:09:23,320 --> 00:09:24,460
[He said he's doing great,]

190
00:09:24,779 --> 00:09:26,120
[and he'll be home in fall!]

191
00:09:38,220 --> 00:09:39,019
Mr. Jiang...

192
00:09:40,419 --> 00:09:40,940
Whatever

193
00:09:40,940 --> 00:09:42,200
we had back then,

194
00:09:43,639 --> 00:09:44,419
I am

195
00:09:45,399 --> 00:09:47,200
Changxuan's wife now.

196
00:09:48,559 --> 00:09:50,120
The past is dead and buried.

197
00:09:51,100 --> 00:09:52,320
We shouldn't be talking like this!

198
00:09:53,460 --> 00:09:54,659
Dead and buried?

199
00:09:55,080 --> 00:09:56,080
You think you two

200
00:09:56,080 --> 00:09:56,700
fell in love naturally?

201
00:09:56,700 --> 00:09:57,799
You think you chose him?

202
00:09:58,100 --> 00:09:58,840
He threw me into a cell

203
00:09:58,840 --> 00:09:59,759
to get to you!

204
00:10:00,000 --> 00:10:01,120
He used my life as a hostage

205
00:10:01,240 --> 00:10:02,519
and kept you locked away at Redleaf!

206
00:10:02,679 --> 00:10:04,000
You literally tried to kill yourself

207
00:10:04,639 --> 00:10:06,080
just to get him to let me walk!

208
00:10:10,080 --> 00:10:11,080
Look at this scar!

209
00:10:12,539 --> 00:10:13,659
You bled

210
00:10:13,659 --> 00:10:14,340
for me!

211
00:10:32,440 --> 00:10:33,259
You're lying!

212
00:10:35,299 --> 00:10:36,860
Changxuan isn't like that!

213
00:10:44,559 --> 00:10:46,200
Oh yeah?

214
00:10:48,559 --> 00:10:49,559
He is

215
00:10:49,559 --> 00:10:51,740
a venomous liar!

216
00:10:52,539 --> 00:10:54,299
He preyed on your amnesia

217
00:10:55,940 --> 00:10:56,419
and stole a woman

218
00:10:56,419 --> 00:10:58,600
who was never his!

219
00:11:03,840 --> 00:11:04,559
Mr. Jiang,

220
00:11:06,860 --> 00:11:08,019
I lost my memory,

221
00:11:09,600 --> 00:11:10,379
not

222
00:11:10,379 --> 00:11:11,460
my judgment!

223
00:11:13,779 --> 00:11:14,320
I know

224
00:11:14,320 --> 00:11:15,700
what kind of man I married.

225
00:11:17,740 --> 00:11:18,480
And I trust

226
00:11:18,480 --> 00:11:19,480
my own heart.

227
00:11:25,059 --> 00:11:25,700
Is that so?

228
00:11:30,899 --> 00:11:32,139
Did he happen to tell you

229
00:11:34,000 --> 00:11:35,240
how your mom died?

230
00:11:39,960 --> 00:11:41,100
What are you talking about?

231
00:11:44,860 --> 00:11:46,279
We were running away

232
00:11:46,679 --> 00:11:48,320
from Nanhuai with her.

233
00:11:49,559 --> 00:11:51,240
He was right on our heels.

234
00:11:51,980 --> 00:11:53,179
Out of nowhere,

235
00:11:53,620 --> 00:11:55,379
our hideout was torched.

236
00:11:55,740 --> 00:11:57,340
You and I made it out alive...

237
00:11:57,440 --> 00:11:58,200
but your mom...

238
00:12:00,259 --> 00:12:01,259
she

239
00:12:05,159 --> 00:12:06,259
never made it out

240
00:12:06,259 --> 00:12:07,120
of the fire.

241
00:12:15,200 --> 00:12:15,960
No...

242
00:12:18,299 --> 00:12:19,220
No, that makes no sense...

243
00:12:20,200 --> 00:12:21,500
Why would he do that?

244
00:12:21,620 --> 00:12:23,259
Because the fire

245
00:12:24,240 --> 00:12:24,919
burned away

246
00:12:24,919 --> 00:12:26,379
the truth!

247
00:12:27,039 --> 00:12:28,620
You never wanted to be with him!

248
00:12:28,679 --> 00:12:30,539
You never had feelings for that butcher!

249
00:12:31,200 --> 00:12:32,480
He covered up the ashes

250
00:12:32,840 --> 00:12:34,200
just to manufacture

251
00:12:34,200 --> 00:12:35,940
a fairytale marriage!

252
00:12:36,340 --> 00:12:37,039
Mr. Jiang.

253
00:12:53,360 --> 00:12:54,500
Here you are.

254
00:12:55,960 --> 00:12:56,919
Quite the search you gave me.

255
00:13:00,139 --> 00:13:01,139
Here already,

256
00:13:03,179 --> 00:13:04,440
General?

257
00:13:05,740 --> 00:13:06,580
Terrified I'd tear

258
00:13:06,580 --> 00:13:07,659
your little mask off?

259
00:13:08,019 --> 00:13:08,820
Mr. Jiang,

260
00:13:10,860 --> 00:13:12,179
mind your place.

261
00:13:13,759 --> 00:13:15,039
Stay the hell away from my wife.

262
00:13:15,960 --> 00:13:17,080
"Your wife?"

263
00:13:18,519 --> 00:13:20,299
How do you say that with a straight face?

264
00:13:22,000 --> 00:13:23,360
Tell her,

265
00:13:24,179 --> 00:13:25,440
did I get a single word wrong?

266
00:13:34,299 --> 00:13:35,879
Look at this little gathering!

267
00:13:36,360 --> 00:13:37,620
Whispering secrets

268
00:13:42,840 --> 00:13:44,159
without inviting me?

269
00:13:46,279 --> 00:13:48,600
You know, Changxuan...

270
00:13:49,159 --> 00:13:49,500
I still remember

271
00:13:49,500 --> 00:13:51,899
the day you walked out on me.

272
00:13:52,000 --> 00:13:53,379
You claimed you weren't worthy of my love.

273
00:13:53,779 --> 00:13:54,860
You swore

274
00:13:54,940 --> 00:13:56,000
I'd find someone better.

275
00:13:56,000 --> 00:13:57,399
Someone who

276
00:13:57,519 --> 00:13:58,940
would love me unconditionally.

277
00:14:02,120 --> 00:14:03,440
Turns out, you were right!

278
00:14:04,679 --> 00:14:05,500
Changxuan,

279
00:14:05,779 --> 00:14:06,340
I really should

280
00:14:06,340 --> 00:14:08,279
thank you for doing me a favor.

281
00:14:08,600 --> 00:14:10,360
If you hadn't broken my heart,

282
00:14:11,919 --> 00:14:13,399
we never would have ended up together.

283
00:15:05,639 --> 00:15:06,779
Whatever you need to know,

284
00:15:08,539 --> 00:15:09,340
just ask.

285
00:15:11,820 --> 00:15:12,620
Will I

286
00:15:15,659 --> 00:15:17,240
get the truth this time?

287
00:15:19,980 --> 00:15:20,759
Every word.

288
00:15:30,600 --> 00:15:32,919
You were gonna marry Ziyi.

289
00:15:35,519 --> 00:15:36,899
And Jiang Xueting...

290
00:15:40,019 --> 00:15:41,600
was my fiancé?

291
00:15:45,340 --> 00:15:46,139
Yes.

292
00:15:55,139 --> 00:15:56,600
You locked him up...

293
00:15:58,820 --> 00:16:00,179
and traded his life

294
00:16:01,659 --> 00:16:03,340
for my surrender?

295
00:16:08,059 --> 00:16:08,879
Yes.

296
00:16:22,480 --> 00:16:23,559
And my mother?

297
00:16:28,139 --> 00:16:29,759
She didn't die of a relapse, did she?

298
00:16:35,539 --> 00:16:36,240
She was killed

299
00:16:36,240 --> 00:16:38,179
in that fire.

300
00:16:51,139 --> 00:16:51,919
Yes.

301
00:16:56,419 --> 00:16:57,519
I lied about everything.

302
00:17:03,740 --> 00:17:04,519
Pingjun...

303
