Dad,

603
00:42:15,079 --> 00:42:16,239
keeping Pingjun

604
00:42:16,760 --> 00:42:18,460
was my choice.

605
00:42:19,300 --> 00:42:20,679
I'm the one who refused to let her go.

606
00:42:21,260 --> 00:42:22,679
Jiang's grudge

607
00:42:22,960 --> 00:42:24,179
is with me.

608
00:42:25,079 --> 00:42:26,500
Pingjun has suffered

609
00:42:26,800 --> 00:42:28,380
far too much.

610
00:42:29,239 --> 00:42:30,760
Don't hold this

611
00:42:31,119 --> 00:42:32,320
against her.

612
00:42:39,960 --> 00:42:41,400
I deceived her every step of the way.

613
00:42:43,659 --> 00:42:45,360
And her mom's death

614
00:42:46,940 --> 00:42:48,260
tore her apart inside.

615
00:42:49,460 --> 00:42:49,820
I carry nothing

616
00:42:49,820 --> 00:42:51,239
but guilt for what I did.

617
00:42:52,539 --> 00:42:54,000
Whatever the consequences,

618
00:42:56,139 --> 00:42:57,920
they're mine to bear.

619
00:42:58,880 --> 00:42:59,679
Stubborn fool...

620
00:43:03,000 --> 00:43:04,079
Don't you worry.

621
00:43:05,000 --> 00:43:06,900
If they lay a dirty hand on you,

622
00:43:08,000 --> 00:43:09,860
I'll turn the guns around

623
00:43:10,800 --> 00:43:13,000
and start a war.

624
00:43:14,639 --> 00:43:16,679
I'm gonna break you out myself!

625
00:43:16,800 --> 00:43:17,320
Don't do it,

626
00:43:18,019 --> 00:43:18,480
Dad.

627
00:43:22,280 --> 00:43:23,820
Draw blood now,

628
00:43:24,480 --> 00:43:25,940
and you play right into their hands.

629
00:43:26,500 --> 00:43:27,019
They aren't

630
00:43:27,019 --> 00:43:29,000
just angling for the arsenal.

631
00:43:30,119 --> 00:43:31,940
They want to swallow us whole.

632
00:43:34,440 --> 00:43:35,579
Hold the fort.

633
00:43:36,480 --> 00:43:39,039
Let me play this out, alright?

634
00:43:40,119 --> 00:43:40,800
Just trust me.

635
00:43:46,960 --> 00:43:47,739
Stay sharp, son.
